  "title": "Shoot Out The Lights",
  "country": "Canada",
  "released": "1982",
  "notes": "This version is pressed in the US by [l264205], as indicated by the runouts, but has distribution information for A&M Canada on both sleeve and inners, and 'Made in Canada' declarations on its labels. \n\nReleased with an inner sleeve printed with lyrics.\n\nMade in Canada. \n\nThe spelling of some track names on the back cover differ slightly from the vinyl label:\n\n\"Don't Renege On Our Love\"\n\"Walking On A Wire\"\n\"Man In Need\"\n\"Just the Motion\"\n\"Shoot Out The Lights\"\n\"Back Street Slide\"\n\"Did She Jump Or Was She Pushed\"\n\"Wall Of Death\"\n\nThe runouts are etched except for STERLING which is stamped.\n",
  "released_formatted": "1982",
